  "description": "<p data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"118\"><strong data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"118\">&bull; Brand introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"146\" data-start=\"143\">GlowKissen is a German-based beauty brand dedicated to supporting natural radiance and healthy skin through smart, ergonomic beauty sleep. Our hero product &ndash; the GlowKissen &ndash; is designed to enhance overnight skin regeneration, reduce sleep wrinkles, and support a fresh, glowing complexion every morning.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"452\"><strong data-end=\"478\" data-start=\"452\">&bull; Product description:</strong><br data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"478\">The GlowKissen is a specially developed beauty pillow that helps prevent sleep wrinkles and supports skin recovery overnight. Its heart-shaped, ergonomic design gently relieves pressure on the face, while promoting ideal head positioning and neck alignment. Made with a comfort memory foam core and a soft, skin-friendly cover, it offers a luxurious and health-conscious sleep experience. Simply place it on top of your regular pillow, no complicated setup needed.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"983\" data-start=\"948\"><strong data-end=\"981\" data-start=\"948\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"984\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"984\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"986\">Reduces sleep wrinkles by relieving facial pressure during sleep</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1109\" data-start=\"1053\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1109\" data-start=\"1055\">Promotes healthy head positioning and neck alignment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1110\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1112\">Skin care stays on your face &ndash; not your pillow</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1216\" data-start=\"1161\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1216\" data-start=\"1163\">Skin-friendly cover and supportive memory foam core</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1287\" data-start=\"1217\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1287\" data-start=\"1219\">Stylish and compact: fits seamlessly on top of your regular pillow</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"1288\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"1290\">Developed in Germany and exclusively available in the DACH region</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1484\" data-start=\"1357\"><strong data-end=\"1377\" data-start=\"1357\">&bull; Payment terms:</strong><br data-end=\"1380\" data-start=\"1377\">Commission: 10% per sale<br data-end=\"1407\" data-start=\"1404\">Payouts via PayPal or bank transfer, processed monthly (no minimum threshold)</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1706\" data-start=\"1486\"><strong data-end=\"1510\" data-start=\"1486\">&bull; Other information:</strong><br data-end=\"1513\" data-start=\"1510\">You&rsquo;ll get your own affiliate dashboard, performance tracking, and regular promo updates.<br data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1602\">High-quality visuals and content are provided for easy promotion via Instagram, TikTok, or your blog.</p>",
